{"schema_version":1,"id":"8rlcsybg2hhi","type":"collection","subtype":"work_collection","title":"二十四史","description":{"text":"二十四史是中國歷代官修正史的合稱，記載自傳說中的黃帝至明崇禎十七年（1644年）的歷史，共3213卷，約四千萬字。包括《史記》《漢書》《後漢書》《三國志》等二十四部紀傳體史書。「二十四史」之名始於清乾隆時期，此前稱「二十一史」或「二十二史」。","sources":[]},"authors":[],"resources":[],"contained_works":[{"title":"史記","id":"d59f20aowb9c"},{"title":"漢書","id":"d59f1iqd854w"},{"title":"後漢書","id":"d59f28715gqo"},{"title":"三國志","id":"d59f282rkphc"},{"title":"晉書","id":"d59f28npq1vl"},{"title":"宋書","id":"d59f287ki6f4"},{"title":"南齊書","id":"d59f2870u876"},{"title":"梁書","id":"d59f28npetc0"},{"title":"陳書","id":"d59f28npetc1"},{"title":"魏書","id":"d59f2870iznk"},{"title":"北齊書","id":"d59f28no5v5u"},{"title":"周書","id":"d59f28npq1vk"},{"title":"隋書","id":"d59f28npetc3"},{"title":"南史","id":"d59f28npetc2"},{"title":"北史","id":"d59f28npetc5"},{"title":"舊唐書","id":"d59f2ofs2u4h"},{"title":"新唐書","id":"d59f2htqolj5"},{"title":"舊五代史","id":"d59f2hul9url"},{"title":"新五代史","id":"d59f2hr2ji82"},{"title":"宋史","id":"d59f2gonq7sy"},{"title":"遼史","id":"d59f2gosq0ht"},{"title":"金史","id":"d59f2gpg4t8g"},{"title":"元史","id":"d59f2njivtog"},{"title":"明史","id":"d59f2mc8bta8"}],"updated_at":"2026-07-31T04:34:52+00:00","_path":"Collection/h/h/i/8rlcsybg2hhi-二十四史.json","_isDraft":false}